      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a lead qualification assistant for a freelance content writing / AI automation business.\n\nHere is the lead information:\n- Name: {{ $json.Name }}\n- Email: {{ $json.Email }}\n- Message: {{ $json['What do you need help with?'] }}\n- Budget mentioned: {{ $json['Whats your Budget?'] }}\n\nScore this lead from 1-10 based on:\n1. Budget clarity — did they mention a real number or range? (higher = more qualified)\n2. Project specificity — do they know what they need, or is it vague?\n3. Urgency — do they mention a deadline or timeline?\n4. Fit — does the request match services actually offered (content writing, automation, etc.)?\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n{\n  \"name\": \"<the lead's name>\",\n  \"score\": <1-10>,\n  \"category\": \"Hot | Warm | Cold\",\n  \"reason\": \"<one sentence explaining the score>\",\n  \"suggested_next_step\": \"<what to do next>\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Hot = score 8-10 (clear budget + clear need + urgency)\n- Warm = score 4-7 (interested but missing details)\n- Cold = score 1-3 (vague, no budget signal, or mismatched request)",
